{"id":"658220","name":"捞汁生菜","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658220/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"生菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"我家勤劳大姑姐种的绿色生菜。","img":"images/658220/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"碗中放入适量的蒜末和小米椒丝。","img":"images/658220/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"烧入热油，呛出香气。","img":"images/658220/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入酱油、陈醋、白糖和小磨香油拌匀，捞汁做好了。","img":"images/658220/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中水烧开，倒入适量的油和盐，放入生菜。","img":"images/658220/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"焯水30秒关火。","img":"images/658220/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"生菜捞出装盘，表面浇入捞汁即可。","img":"images/658220/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658220/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}